                    <div class="submission__content flow-slim">
              <div class="submission__body break-text text-flow"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">I mean it doesn’t make much sense, does it? How is the watch more expensive than the iPhone SE? It doesn’t have a camera, it has a smaller display, it has a smaller battery, it can’t make phone calls, it has a worse chip, it has less storage, the speakers are worse as well and doesn’t have 5G.</p>
<p lang="en" dir="ltr">So what is that makes it 2.5x times more expensive (429$ vs 999$) ?</p>
</div>
